-- title:
--   Direct original zero-jump X controlled stopped C2 full Gaussian finite Ito mesh residual expectation zero
-- statement:
--   On the exact original spectrally negative Levy X with zero jump measure, finite sums of source-controlled stopped C2 gradient increments and one-half Hessian times compensated Gaussian quadratic increments are integrable with exactly zero mean. Their original X sigma squared correction, source rightLimit dividend reserve, left-limit derivative and ruin gate are all explicit. No auxiliary Gaussian witness is assumed.
-- source:
--   Specialisation of accepted all-nu original-source Gaussian C2 compensated finite mesh mean-zero theorem, choosing Y=X and zero jump fields.

import Mathlib.MeasureTheory.Integral.Bochner.Basic
